    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEOWDAY, MEOWDAY! REMOTE OPERATORS, WE NEED YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citadrill is recruiting ambitious self-starters to become remote operators! Tired of your office job? Then come shepherd a moving base in an exciting and dynamic workplace called the \u2728abyss\u2728. Drill for resources, build weapons, and decide how to allocate materials. Every decision will count as you manage your cat-izens, explore hazardous environments, and fight off monsters. Don't fret if one expedition ends in disaster\u2014 you can always start a new run!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No previous experience required! We will offer on-the-job training. Sound great? Read on to find out if you're our next rockstar remote operator.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD IN A FAST-PACED ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be in charge of building what your workers need and acquiring what's necessary for the drill's survival. Plop buildings down in your moving settlement, assign workers to stations, and create a flourishing, efficient Citadrill with lots of happy workers\u2026 and fancy weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND WEAR LOTS OF HATS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to build and keep your cat-izens thriving, you'll embark on missions into the eerie abyss. Brave the unknown for resources while keeping your drill intact and crew alive. Different environments will also require different adaptations and tactics. The abyss is also a wonderfully diverse ecosystem! Encounter everything from eccentric \u2013 but somehow wildly successful \u2013 shop keepers, to giant ice \u2018shrimps\u2019 with a taste for stray drills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE\u2026 AND TRAUMA BOND\u2013ER, WE MEAN, BECOME FAMILY\u2026 WITH CAT COWORKERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many underground monsters are\u2026unfriendly, to put it lightly. But! We believe the right remote operator can tackle the challenge of going toe-to-toe with colossal citapedes, refusing to back down when faced with difficult enemies or hazardous environments. And you won't be alone! C.A.T. is a dependable Drill O.S. who will accompany you through <span class=\"bb_strike\">any number of horrors</span> daily tasks and trials.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/31a33ad4927b0bd3013aedffda0e132a.avif?t=1750775522\" width=656 height=820 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEOWDAY, MEOWDAY! REMOTE OPERATORS, WE NEED YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citadrill is recruiting ambitious self-starters to become remote operators! Tired of your office job? Then come shepherd a moving base in an exciting and dynamic workplace called the \u2728abyss\u2728. Drill for resources, build weapons, and decide how to allocate materials. Every decision will count as you manage your cat-izens, explore hazardous environments, and fight off monsters. Don't fret if one expedition ends in disaster\u2014 you can always start a new run!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No previous experience required! We will offer on-the-job training. Sound great? Read on to find out if you're our next rockstar remote operator.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD IN A FAST-PACED ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be in charge of building what your workers need and acquiring what's necessary for the drill's survival. Plop buildings down in your moving settlement, assign workers to stations, and create a flourishing, efficient Citadrill with lots of happy workers\u2026 and fancy weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/b09a78ebe27961cb042caad56b26b873.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND WEAR LOTS OF HATS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to build and keep your cat-izens thriving, you'll embark on missions into the eerie abyss. Brave the unknown for resources while keeping your drill intact and crew alive. Different environments will also require different adaptations and tactics. The abyss is also a wonderfully diverse ecosystem! Encounter everything from eccentric \u2013 but somehow wildly successful \u2013 shop keepers, to giant ice \u2018shrimps\u2019 with a taste for stray drills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/647531e14118187228419c33cee7f101.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE\u2026 AND TRAUMA BOND\u2013ER, WE MEAN, BECOME FAMILY\u2026 WITH CAT COWORKERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many underground monsters are\u2026unfriendly, to put it lightly. But! We believe the right remote operator can tackle the challenge of going toe-to-toe with colossal citapedes, refusing to back down when faced with difficult enemies or hazardous environments. And you won't be alone! C.A.T. is a dependable Drill O.S. who will accompany you through <span class=\"bb_strike\">any number of horrors</span> daily tasks and trials.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.poster.avif?t=1750775522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.webm?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/f4c3d4e3c42afba89e64c572ae396a7d.mp4?t=1750775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465440/extras/31a33ad4927b0bd3013aedffda0e132a.avif?t=1750775522\" width=656 height=820 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Captain a giant drill in this basebuilder roguelite with a combination of action and strategy! Build, explore, and survive in a world inspired by 1-bit aesthetics. Who will win: the abyss and its fearsome tests, or your mettle and paw-some cat crew?",
